# Frontend Integration Guide - User Search & Filter

## API Endpoint Summary

### 1. Search & Filter Users
```
GET /api/users/search
```

### 2. Get Contact Information  
```
GET /api/users/contact-info
```

---

## Query Parameters Reference

| Parameter | Type | Optional | Default | Mô tả |
|-----------|------|----------|---------|-------|
| `fullName` | string | Yes | - | Tìm kiếm theo tên (LIKE %value%) |
| `email` | string | Yes | - | Tìm kiếm theo email (LIKE %value%) |
| `phone` | string | Yes | - | Tìm kiếm theo phone (exact match) |
| `role` | string | Yes | - | Lọc theo role (ADMIN, USER, STAFF, etc.) |
| `isActive` | boolean | Yes | - | Lọc theo trạng thái active (true/false) |
| `pageNumber` | integer | Yes | 0 | Số trang (0-indexed) |
| `pageSize` | integer | Yes | 10 | Số record mỗi trang |
| `sortBy` | string | Yes | "id" | Trường sắp xếp |
| `sortOrder` | string | Yes | "ASC" | Thứ tự sắp xếp (ASC/DESC) |

---

## Frontend Usage Examples

### JavaScript Fetch API
```javascript
// Simple search
const response = await fetch(
  '/api/users/search?fullName=John&pageSize=10'
);
const data = await response.json();

// Advanced filter
const params = new URLSearchParams({
  fullName: 'John',
  role: 'ADMIN',
  isActive: 'true',
  pageNumber: '0',
  pageSize: '20',
  sortBy: 'fullName',
  sortOrder: 'ASC'
});

const response = await fetch(`/api/users/search?${params}`);
const data = await response.json();
```

### Axios
```javascript
import axios from 'axios';

const searchUsers = (filters) => {
  return axios.get('/api/users/search', {
    params: {
      fullName: filters.fullName,
      email: filters.email,
      phone: filters.phone,
      role: filters.role,
      isActive: filters.isActive,
      pageNumber: filters.pageNumber || 0,
      pageSize: filters.pageSize || 10,
      sortBy: filters.sortBy || 'id',
      sortOrder: filters.sortOrder || 'ASC'
    }
  });
};

// Usage
searchUsers({
  fullName: 'John',
  role: 'ADMIN',
  pageSize: 10
}).then(response => {
  console.log(response.data);
});
```

### React Hook
```javascript
import { useState, useEffect } from 'react';

function UserSearch() {
  const [filters, setFilters] = useState({
    fullName: '',
    email: '',
    phone: '',
    role: 'ALL_ROLES',
    isActive: null,
    pageNumber: 0,
    pageSize: 10,
    sortBy: 'id',
    sortOrder: 'ASC'
  });

  const [users, setUsers] = useState([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);

  const handleSearch = async () => {
    setLoading(true);
    try {
      const params = new URLSearchParams();
      Object.keys(filters).forEach(key => {
        const value = filters[key];
        if (value || value === false) {
          if (key === 'role' && value === 'ALL_ROLES') return;
          params.append(key, value);
        }
      });

      const response = await fetch(`/api/users/search?${params}`);
      const data = await response.json();
      setUsers(data.content);
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Search error:', error);
    } finally {
      setLoading(false);
    }
  };

  return (
    <div>
      <input
        placeholder="Search name..."
        value={filters.fullName}
        onChange={(e) => setFilters({ ...filters, fullName: e.target.value })}
      />
      <input
        placeholder="Search email..."
        value={filters.email}
        onChange={(e) => setFilters({ ...filters, email: e.target.value })}
      />
      <input
        placeholder="Search phone..."
        value={filters.phone}
        onChange={(e) => setFilters({ ...filters, phone: e.target.value })}
      />
      <select
        value={filters.role}
        onChange={(e) => setFilters({ ...filters, role: e.target.value })}
      >
        <option>ALL_ROLES</option>
        <option>ADMIN</option>
        <option>USER</option>
        <option>STAFF</option>
      </select>

      <button onClick={handleSearch} disabled={loading}>
        {loading ? 'Loading...' : 'Search'}
      </button>

      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>ID</th>
            <th>Name</th>
            <th>Email</th>
            <th>Phone</th>
            <th>Role</th>
            <th>Status</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {users.map(user => (
            <tr key={user.id}>
              <td>{user.id}</td>
              <td>{user.fullName}</td>
              <td>{user.email}</td>
              <td>{user.phone}</td>
              <td>{user.role}</td>
              <td>{user.active ? 'Active' : 'Inactive'}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  );
}

export default UserSearch;
```

### Vue 3 Composition API
```javascript
<template>
  <div class="user-search">
    <div class="search-inputs">
      <input 
        v-model="filters.fullName"
        placeholder="Search by name..."
        @input="performSearch"
      />
      <input 
        v-model="filters.email"
        placeholder="Search by email..."
        @input="performSearch"
      />
      <input 
        v-model="filters.phone"
        placeholder="Search by phone..."
        @input="performSearch"
      />
      <select 
        v-model="filters.role"
        @change="performSearch"
      >
        <option value="ALL_ROLES">All Roles</option>
        <option value="ADMIN">Admin</option>
        <option value="USER">User</option>
        <option value="STAFF">Staff</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <table v-if="users.length">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th @click="sortBy('id')">ID</th>
          <th @click="sortBy('fullName')">Name</th>
          <th>Email</th>
          <th>Phone</th>
          <th>Role</th>
          <th @click="sortBy('active')">Status</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr v-for="user in users" :key="user.id">
          <td>{{ user.id }}</td>
          <td>{{ user.fullName }}</td>
          <td>{{ user.email }}</td>
          <td>{{ user.phone }}</td>
          <td>{{ user.role }}</td>
          <td>{{ user.active ? 'Active' : 'Inactive' }}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="pagination">
      <button @click="previousPage" :disabled="filters.pageNumber === 0">
        Previous
      </button>
      <span>Page {{ filters.pageNumber + 1 }} of {{ totalPages }}</span>
      <button @click="nextPage" :disabled="filters.pageNumber >= totalPages - 1">
        Next
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</template>

<script setup>
import { ref, reactive } from 'vue';

const filters = reactive({
  fullName: '',
  email: '',
  phone: '',
  role: 'ALL_ROLES',
  isActive: null,
  pageNumber: 0,
  pageSize: 10,
  sortBy: 'id',
  sortOrder: 'ASC'
});

const users = ref([]);
const totalPages = ref(0);
const loading = ref(false);

const performSearch = async () => {
  loading.value = true;
  try {
    const query = new URLSearchParams();

    if (filters.fullName) query.append('fullName', filters.fullName);
    if (filters.email) query.append('email', filters.email);
    if (filters.phone) query.append('phone', filters.phone);
    if (filters.role !== 'ALL_ROLES') query.append('role', filters.role);
    if (filters.isActive !== null) query.append('isActive', filters.isActive);

    query.append('pageNumber', filters.pageNumber);
    query.append('pageSize', filters.pageSize);
    query.append('sortBy', filters.sortBy);
    query.append('sortOrder', filters.sortOrder);

    const response = await fetch(`/api/users/search?${query}`);
    const data = await response.json();

    users.value = data.content;
    totalPages.value = data.totalPages;
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('Search error:', error);
  } finally {
    loading.value = false;
  }
};

const sortBy = (field) => {
  if (filters.sortBy === field) {
    filters.sortOrder = filters.sortOrder === 'ASC' ? 'DESC' : 'ASC';
  } else {
    filters.sortBy = field;
    filters.sortOrder = 'ASC';
  }
  performSearch();
};

const previousPage = () => {
  if (filters.pageNumber > 0) {
    filters.pageNumber--;
    performSearch();
  }
};

const nextPage = () => {
  if (filters.pageNumber < totalPages.value - 1) {
    filters.pageNumber++;
    performSearch();
  }
};

// Load initial data
performSearch();
</script>
```

---

## Response Format

### Success Response (200)
```json
{
  "content": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "email": "alex@skystream.com",
      "fullName": "Alex Turner",
      "phone": "+84987654321",
      "role": "OWNER",
      "lastLoginAt": "2024-05-12T10:30:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "email": "jane@example.com",
      "fullName": "Jane Smith",
      "phone": "+84123456789",
      "role": "USER",
      "lastLoginAt": "2024-05-11T15:45:00"
    }
  ],
  "pageable": {
    "pageNumber": 0,
    "pageSize": 20,
    "paged": true,
    "unpaged": false
  },
  "sort": {
    "empty": false,
    "sorted": true,
    "unsorted": false
  },
  "totalElements": 3,
  "totalPages": 1,
  "number": 0,
  "size": 20,
  "numberOfElements": 3,
  "first": true,
  "last": true,
  "empty": false
}
```

### Contact Info Response (200)
```json
[
  {
    "fullName": "Alex Turner",
    "email": "alex@skystream.com",
    "phone": "+84987654321"
  },
  {
    "fullName": "Jane Smith",
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "phone": "+84123456789"
  }
]
```

---

## Common Use Cases

### 1. Filter by Role
```
GET /api/users/search?role=ADMIN&pageSize=20
```

### 2. Search Name + Active Status
```
GET /api/users/search?fullName=John&isActive=true
```

### 3. Sort by Name Descending
```
GET /api/users/search?sortBy=fullName&sortOrder=DESC&pageSize=50
```

### 4. Pagination
```
GET /api/users/search?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
```

### 5. Complex Query
```
GET /api/users/search?fullName=John&role=ADMIN&isActive=true&sortBy=fullName&sortOrder=ASC&pageSize=20
```

---

## Tips for Frontend

1. **Debounce Search** - Add delay to avoid too many API calls while typing
2. **Loading State** - Show loading indicator while fetching
3. **Error Handling** - Catch and display errors to users
4. **Pagination** - Implement prev/next buttons or page number selector
5. **Sorting** - Allow users to click column headers to sort
6. **Case Insensitive** - Backend handles this, no need to convert frontend inputs

---

**Ready to integrate!** Copy examples and adapt to your frontend framework.

# Tài liệu hướng dẫn Search, Filter và Sort Users

## Tổng quan
Đã triển khai hệ thống tìm kiếm, lọc và sắp xếp người dùng sử dụng **JpaSpecificationExecutor** cho phép xây dựng các truy vấn động mà không cần viết JPQL.

## Các file được tạo/cập nhật

### 1. **UserSearchFilterDTO** 
 `common-lib/src/main/java/com/example/payload/dto/UserSearchFilterDTO.java`

DTO chứa các tham số tìm kiếm:
```java
{
  "fullName": "John",           // Tìm kiếm trong tên (case-insensitive, partial match)
  "email": "@example.com",      // Tìm kiếm trong email (case-insensitive, partial match)
  "phone": "+84987654321",      // Tìm kiếm phone (exact match)
  "role": "ADMIN",              // Lọc theo role (ADMIN, USER, STAFF, etc.)
  "isActive": true,             // Lọc theo trạng thái active
  "pageNumber": 0,              // Trang (0-indexed)
  "pageSize": 10,               // Số lượng bản ghi mỗi trang
  "sortBy": "id",               // Trường sắp xếp (id, fullName, email, createdAt, etc.)
  "sortOrder": "ASC"            // ASC hoặc DESC
}
```

### 2. **UserSpecification**
 `user-service/src/main/java/com/example/repository/specification/UserSpecification.java`

Lớp xây dựng các Specification động:
```java
public static Specification<Users> buildUserSpecification(
    String fullName,
    String email,
    String phone,
    UserRole role,
    Boolean isActive)
```

**Chức năng:**
- Tìm kiếm tên: LIKE "%fullName%" (case-insensitive)
- Tìm kiếm email: LIKE "%email%" (case-insensitive)
- Tìm kiếm phone: = "phone" (exact match)
- Lọc role: = role
- Lọc active: = isActive
- Luôn loại bỏ deleted users

### 3. **UserRepository**
 `user-service/src/main/java/com/example/repository/UserRepository.java`

Cập nhật:
```java
public interface UserRepository extends JpaRepository<Users, Long>, JpaSpecificationExecutor<Users>
```

### 4. **UserService Interface & Implementation**
 `user-service/src/main/java/com/example/service/UserService.java`
 `user-service/src/main/java/com/example/service/impl/UserServiceImpl.java`

Phương thức chính:
```java
Page<UserResponse> searchAndFilterUsers(UserSearchFilterDTO searchFilter);
List<Map<String, String>> getUsersContactInfo();
```

### 5. **UserController**
 `user-service/src/main/java/com/example/controller/UserController.java`

Hai endpoint mới:

#### **GET /api/users/search** - Tìm kiếm và lọc người dùng
```
Query Parameters:
- fullName (optional): Tìm kiếm tên - "?fullName=John"
- email (optional): Tìm kiếm email - "?email=example.com"
- phone (optional): Tìm kiếm phone - "?phone=+84987654321"
- role (optional): Lọc role - "?role=ADMIN"
- isActive (optional): Lọc trạng thái - "?isActive=true"
- pageNumber (optional, default=0): "?pageNumber=0"
- pageSize (optional, default=10): "?pageSize=10"
- sortBy (optional, default=id): "?sortBy=fullName"
- sortOrder (optional, default=ASC): "?sortOrder=ASC"
```

**Ví dụ:**
```
GET /api/users/search?fullName=John&role=ADMIN&pageNumber=0&pageSize=20&sortBy=id&sortOrder=DESC
GET /api/users/search?email=@skystream.com&isActive=true
GET /api/users/search?phone=%2B84987654321&role=USER
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "content": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "email": "john@example.com",
      "fullName": "John Doe",
      "phone": "+84987654321",
      "role": "ADMIN",
      "lastLoginAt": "2024-05-12T10:30:00"
    }
  ],
  "pageable": {
    "pageNumber": 0,
    "pageSize": 10,
    "sort": {
      "sorted": true,
      "direction": "ASC"
    }
  },
  "totalElements": 5,
  "totalPages": 1,
  "last": true
}
```

#### **GET /api/users/contact-info** - Lấy thông tin liên hệ
```
GET /api/users/contact-info
```

**Response:**
```json
[
  {
    "fullName": "Alex Turner",
    "email": "alex@skystream.com",
    "phone": "+84 987 654 321"
  },
  {
    "fullName": "Jane Smith",
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "phone": "+84 123 456 789"
  }
]
```

## Cách sử dụng trong Frontend

### **React Example:**
```javascript
// Tìm kiếm và lọc người dùng
const searchUsers = async (filters) => {
  const params = new URLSearchParams();

  if (filters.fullName) params.append('fullName', filters.fullName);
  if (filters.email) params.append('email', filters.email);
  if (filters.phone) params.append('phone', filters.phone);
  if (filters.role && filters.role !== 'ALL_ROLES') {
    params.append('role', filters.role);
  }
  if (filters.isActive !== undefined) params.append('isActive', filters.isActive);

  params.append('pageNumber', filters.pageNumber || 0);
  params.append('pageSize', filters.pageSize || 10);
  params.append('sortBy', filters.sortBy || 'id');
  params.append('sortOrder', filters.sortOrder || 'ASC');

  const response = await fetch(`/api/users/search?${params}`);
  return response.json();
};

// Sử dụng
const filters = {
  fullName: 'John',
  role: 'ADMIN',
  isActive: true,
  pageNumber: 0,
  pageSize: 10,
  sortBy: 'id',
  sortOrder: 'ASC'
};

const results = await searchUsers(filters);
```

### **Vue.js Example:**
```javascript
// Trong component
data() {
  return {
    filters: {
      fullName: '',
      email: '',
      phone: '',
      role: 'ALL_ROLES',
      isActive: null,
      pageNumber: 0,
      pageSize: 10,
      sortBy: 'id',
      sortOrder: 'ASC'
    },
    users: [],
    totalElements: 0,
    totalPages: 0
  }
},
methods: {
  async performSearch() {
    try {
      const query = new URLSearchParams();

      if (this.filters.fullName) query.append('fullName', this.filters.fullName);
      if (this.filters.email) query.append('email', this.filters.email);
      if (this.filters.phone) query.append('phone', this.filters.phone);
      if (this.filters.role !== 'ALL_ROLES') query.append('role', this.filters.role);
      if (this.filters.isActive !== null) query.append('isActive', this.filters.isActive);

      query.append('pageNumber', this.filters.pageNumber);
      query.append('pageSize', this.filters.pageSize);
      query.append('sortBy', this.filters.sortBy);
      query.append('sortOrder', this.filters.sortOrder);

      const response = await fetch(`/api/users/search?${query}`);
      const data = await response.json();

      this.users = data.content;
      this.totalElements = data.totalElements;
      this.totalPages = data.totalPages;
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Search error:', error);
    }
  }
}
```

## Tính năng chính

✅ **Tìm kiếm flexible:**
- Tìm kiếm tên (case-insensitive, partial match)
- Tìm kiếm email (case-insensitive, partial match)  
- Tìm kiếm phone (exact match)

✅ **Lọc dữ liệu:**
- Lọc theo role (ADMIN, USER, STAFF, etc.)
- Lọc theo trạng thái active

✅ **Sắp xếp:**
- Sắp xếp theo bất kỳ field nào (id, fullName, email, createdAt, etc.)
- Hỗ trợ ASC/DESC

✅ **Phân trang:**
- Hỗ trợ pageNumber, pageSize
- Trả về thông tin về tổng bản ghi, tổng trang

✅ **Thông tin liên hệ:**
- Lấy danh sách tên, email, phone của tất cả người dùng

✅ **Bộ lọc kết hợp:**
- Có thể kết hợp nhiều điều kiện tìm kiếm cùng một lúc

## Database Query
Sử dụng JpaSpecificationExecutor tạo Dynamic SQL:
```sql
-- Ví dụ query được sinh ra
SELECT u FROM Users u 
WHERE u.deleted = false 
  AND LOWER(u.fullName) LIKE '%john%'
  AND u.role = 'ADMIN'
  AND u.active = true
ORDER BY u.id ASC
LIMIT 10 OFFSET 0
```

## Lợi ích của JpaSpecificationExecutor

1. **Không cần hardcode JPQL** - Xây dựng query động tại runtime
2. **Type-safe** - Không lỗi syntax khi compile
3. **Reusable** - Có thể tái sử dụng các specification
4. **Maintainable** - Dễ bảo trì và mở rộng
5. **Performance** - Tạo optimal queries từ các criteria được cung cấp

---

**Hoàn thành! Hệ thống tìm kiếm, lọc và sắp xếp đã sẵn sàng để triển khai trong frontend.**

