## Complete Integration Flow

```
User Interface
      ↓
Filter Input (name, email, phone, role, page, sort)
      ↓
React Component State Update
      ↓
Debounced API Call
      ↓
GET /api/users/search?fullName=...&email=...&role=...&pageNumber=...
      ↓
UserController.searchAndFilterUsers()
      ↓
UserServiceImpl.searchAndFilterUsers()
      ↓
UserRepository.findAll(Specification, Pageable)
      ↓
JpaSpecificationExecutor (Dynamic SQL)
      ↓
Database Query (optimized)
      ↓
Page<Users> Result
      ↓
Convert to UserResponse DTO
      ↓
JSON Response (Page object)
      ↓
React Component Updates Table
      ↓
User sees filtered/sorted results with pagination
```

